#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/get-table-info.php:22
msgid "Get wpDataTable Info"
msgstr "Pridobi informacije o wpDataTable"

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/get-table-info.php:23
msgid "Returns the full configuration of a single wpDataTable by ID, including title, source type, SQL query or file source, database connection, column definitions (name, type, label, visibility, position, filter type, sorting, text_before/text_after for prefix/suffix), and behavioural flags. Use this after list-tables to understand a table's structure before querying its data. WHEN TO CALL: before reading rows, changing settings, or creating a chart from a table — whenever you need column names (orig_header), types, filters, or whether server_side is enabled. REQUIRED INPUT: table_id (integer) from list-tables. RETURNS: full table config including columns[] with orig_header, display_header, type, filter_type, visible, server_side, pagination, sorting, filtering, and more. TYPICAL WORKFLOW: list-tables → get-table-info → get-table-data (use orig_header values for order_by and column_search). For Simple tables (table_type=simple), use create-simple-table / update-simple-table-styles instead of update-table-settings."
msgstr "Vrne celotno konfiguracijo posamezne tabele wpDataTable po ID-ju, vključno z naslovom, vrsto vira, poizvedbo SQL ali izvorno datoteko, povezavo z zbirko podatkov, definicijami stolpcev (ime, vrsta, oznaka, vidnost, položaj, vrsta filtra, razvrščanje, text_before/text_after za predpono/pripono) in vedenjskimi zastavicami. Uporabite to po list-tables, da razumete strukturo tabele, preden poizvedujete po njenih podatkih. KDAJ KLICATI: pred branjem vrstic, spreminjanjem nastavitev ali ustvarjanjem grafikona iz tabele – kadar koli potrebujete imena stolpcev (orig_header), vrste, filtre ali ali je omogočena možnost server_side. OBVEZEN VNOS: table_id (celo število) iz list-tables. VRNITVE: celotna konfiguracija tabele, vključno s stolpci[] z orig_header, display_header, tipom, tipom filtra, visible, strežnikom, oštevilčenjem, razvrščanjem, filtriranjem in še več. POVPREČEN POSTOPEK DELA: list-tables → get-table-info → get-table-data (uporabite vrednosti orig_header za order_by in column_search). Za preproste tabele (table_type=simple) uporabite create-simple-table / update-simple-table-styles namesto update-table-settings."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/get-table-info.php:97
msgid "Requires table_id from list-tables. Inspect columns.orig_header, table_type, and server_side before calling get-table-data, update-table-settings, or create-chart."
msgstr "Zahteva table_id iz seznama tabel. Pred klicem get-table-data, update-table-settings ali create-chart preverite columns.orig_header, table_type in server_side."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/import-table-from-source.php:24
msgid "Import Table from File/URL"
msgstr "Uvozi tabelo iz datoteke/URL-ja"

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/import-table-from-source.php:25
msgid "Imports CSV, Excel, or Google Spreadsheet data into a MySQL table once. Result is editable and better for large datasets than create-table-from-source. For local files use upload-data-file (base64) or attachment_id from Media Library. Use source_url for public remote URLs. Requires Standard tier (update-manual-from-file integration). WHEN TO CALL: user wants file data copied into the database once. REQUIRED: title, source_type (csv|xls|google_spreadsheet). PROVIDE ONE OF: attachment_id OR source_url."
msgstr "Enkrat uvozi podatke iz datotek CSV, Excel ali Google Spreadsheet v tabelo MySQL. Rezultat je mogoče urejati in je boljši za velike nabore podatkov kot create-table-from-source. Za lokalne datoteke uporabite upload-data-file (base64) ali attachment_id iz medijske knjižnice. Za javne oddaljene URL-je uporabite source_url. Zahteva standardno plast (integracija update-manual-from-file). KDAJ KLICATI: uporabnik želi, da se podatki datoteke enkrat kopirajo v bazo podatkov. OBVEZNO: title, source_type (csv|xls|google_spreadsheet). NAVEDITE ENO OD: attachment_id ALI source_url."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/import-table-from-source.php:75
msgid "Requires Standard tier (check get-system-info). Imports file data into MySQL once. Use attachment_id or source_url; prefer this over create-table-from-source for large editable datasets."
msgstr "Zahteva standardno raven (preverite get-system-info). Podatke datoteke enkrat uvozi v MySQL. Uporabite attachment_id ali source_url; za velike nabore podatkov, ki jih je mogoče urejati, je to prednost pred create-table-from-source."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/import-table-from-source.php:100
msgid "Import from file requires wpDataTables Standard tier (Update Manual From File integration). Use create-table-from-source for linked tables on Free/Starter."
msgstr "Za uvoz iz datoteke je potrebna standardna raven wpDataTables (integracija »Priročnik za posodobitve iz datoteke«). Za povezane tabele v različicah Free/Starter uporabite create-table-from-source."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/import-table-from-source.php:113
msgid "wpDataTables constructor classes are required."
msgstr "Konstruktorski razredi wpDataTables so obvezni."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/import-table-from-source.php:128
msgid "Invalid source_type. Use: csv, xls, google_spreadsheet. JSON/XML not supported for import."
msgstr "Neveljavna vrsta_vira. Uporabite: csv, xls, google_spreadsheet. JSON/XML ni podprt za uvoz."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/import-table-from-source.php:182
msgid "File is empty or could not be resolved to a valid path/URL."
msgstr "Datoteka je prazna ali je ni bilo mogoče razrešiti v veljavno pot/URL."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/import-table-from-source.php:192
msgid "Source path or URL is not valid. Supported: CSV, XLS, XLSX, ODS, or Google Spreadsheet URL."
msgstr "Izvorna pot ali URL ni veljaven. Podprto: CSV, XLS, XLSX, ODS ali URL Google Preglednice."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/import-table-from-source.php:255
msgid "Import completed but table ID could not be retrieved."
msgstr "Uvoz je končan, vendar ID-ja tabele ni bilo mogoče pridobiti."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/list-charts.php:19
msgid "List wpDataTables Charts"
msgstr "Seznam grafikonov wpDataTables"

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/list-charts.php:20
msgid "Returns a list of all charts created in wpDataTables, including each chart's ID and title. Use this to discover available charts before inspecting a specific chart with get-chart-info. WHEN TO CALL: when the user asks about existing charts, needs a chart ID, or wants to inspect or modify chart configuration. No parameters are required — pass an empty object {}. RETURNS: { charts: [{ id, title }], count }. TYPICAL NEXT STEP: call get-chart-info with chart_id to see engine, type, linked table, columns, and display options. To create a new chart, use create-chart instead (after get-system-info and get-table-info)."
msgstr "Vrne seznam vseh grafikonov, ustvarjenih v wpDataTables, vključno z ID-jem in naslovom vsakega grafikona. To uporabite za odkrivanje razpoložljivih grafikonov, preden pregledate določen grafikon z ukazom get-chart-info. KDAJ KLICATI: ko uporabnik vpraša o obstoječih grafikonih, potrebuje ID grafikona ali želi pregledati ali spremeniti konfiguracijo grafikona. Parametri niso potrebni – podajte prazen objekt {}. RETURNS: { charts: [{ id, title }], count }. POVPREČEN NASLEDNJI KORAK: pokličite get-chart-info z chart_id, da si ogledate možnosti mehanizma, tipa, povezane tabele, stolpcev in prikaza. Če želite ustvariti nov grafikon, namesto tega uporabite ukaz create-chart (po ukazih get-system-info in get-table-info)."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/list-charts.php:73
msgid "Failed to retrieve charts from wpDataTables."
msgstr "Pridobivanje grafikonov iz wpDataTables ni uspelo."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/list-db-tables.php:23
msgid "List Database Tables"
msgstr "Seznam tabel baze podatkov"

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/list-db-tables.php:24
msgid "Lists all database tables (and optionally their columns) available on a given connection. Use connection=\"\" or omit it for the default WordPress database. Provide a connection ID (from get-system-info) to list tables on a separate MySQL/MSSQL/PostgreSQL connection. The AI can use this to discover schemas before building SQL queries for create-table-from-query. WHEN TO CALL: before writing SQL or creating a query-based table — when you need to know which raw database tables exist. OPTIONAL INPUT: connection (string, empty = WordPress DB; use IDs from get-system-info), include_columns (boolean, default false — set true to get column names/types in one call). RETURNS: { connection, vendor, tables: [{ name, columns? }] }. TYPICAL WORKFLOW: get-system-info → list-db-tables → describe-db-table (for one table detail) → create-table-from-query. NOT for wpDataTables themselves — use list-tables for those."
msgstr "Navede vse tabele baze podatkov (in po izbiri njihove stolpce), ki so na voljo na dani povezavi. Za privzeto bazo podatkov WordPress uporabite connection=&quot;&quot; ali ga izpustite. Navedite ID povezave (iz get-system-info), da naštejete tabele na ločeni povezavi MySQL/MSSQL/PostgreSQL. Umetna inteligenca lahko to uporabi za odkrivanje shem, preden zgradi poizvedbe SQL za create-table-from-query. KDAJ KLICATI: pred pisanjem SQL ali ustvarjanjem tabele, ki temelji na poizvedbah – ko morate vedeti, katere surove tabele baze podatkov obstajajo. IZBIRNI VNOS: connection (string, empty = WordPress DB; uporabite ID-je iz get-system-info), include_columns (boolean, privzeto false – nastavite true, da dobite imena/vrste stolpcev v enem klicu). VRNITEV: { connection, vendor, tables: [{ name, columns? }] }. TIPIČEN POSTOPEK DELA: get-system-info → list-db-tables → describe-db-table (za eno podrobnost tabele) → create-table-from-query. NE za same wpDataTables – za te uporabite list-tables."

#: backend/src/Infrastructure/WP/MCP/Abilities/list-db-tables.php:71
msgid "Optional connection from get-system-info; omit or use empty string for the WordPress database. Set include_columns=true to get column names in one call. Use before create-table-from-query."
msgstr "Neobvezna povezava iz get-system-info; za podatkovno bazo WordPress izpustite ali uporabite prazen niz. Nastavite include_columns=true, da dobite imena stolpcev v enem klicu. Uporabite pred create-table-from-query."

