#: templates/admin/table-settings/sql_query_notice_block.inc.php:10
msgid ""
"wpDataTables is deeply integrated with the MySQL engine. \n"
"            It allows you to display results of SQL query in a table, you can use MySQL server to do searches/filters/sorting/pagination for large datasets,\n"
"             it allows front-end (and back-end) editing of MySQL tables, creating MySQL tables from back-end, and much more."
msgstr "wpDataTables je globoko integriran z mehanizmom MySQL. Omogoča vam prikaz rezultatov poizvedb SQL v tabeli, uporabo strežnika MySQL za iskanje/filtriranje/razvrščanje/oštevilčenje velikih naborov podatkov, urejanje tabel MySQL v vmesniku (in v ozadju), ustvarjanje tabel MySQL iz ozadja in še veliko več."

